<!--
    Device VINTF manifest for poplar: the stock TB311XU base manifest
    (/vendor/etc/vintf/manifest.xml, firmware 37.350.260708W), without the
    <sepolicy> version: assemble_vintf fills in BOARD_SEPOLICY_VERS.
    HALs with their own fragment live in /vendor/etc/vintf/manifest/.
    Stock declares target-level 6, but Android 17 has no FCM 6 matrix any more, so
    this uses 7, the lowest it supports. At level 7 the kernel level may not be
    set; libvintf derives it from the kernel version (6.6: 202404).
-->
